    ],
    "Description": "自動酒量檢定觸發點 (難度6)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 38,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      39,
      56
    ],
    "Description": "第一輪酒量檢定後緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 39,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（烈酒入喉，你面不改色，反而笑得愈發狂放。這份氣魄與酒量，讓在場眾人皆是眼前一亮。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,AlcoholTolerance,10);",
    "links": [
      40
    ],
    "Condition": "IsPassDice() == true",
    "Description": "第一輪酒量檢定成功"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 40,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "「[em7]重重一拍桌子，大聲叫好[/em7]，好小子！就衝你這份酒量和豪氣，我呂信交定你這兄弟了！來，滿上！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      41
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 41,
    "actorID": "MC3",
    "text": "[panel=2]「[em7]舉起酒碗，微微點頭[/em7]，……氣度不凡。這杯，我陪你。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC3,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      42
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 42,
    "actorID": "MC7",
    "text": "[panel=3]「[em7]笑意更深[/em7]，哈哈，有意思！這酒，喝得痛快！當浮一大白！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC7,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(3,MC7,Idea);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC2,10);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC3,10);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC7,10);",
    "links": [
      43
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 43,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（一碗接著一碗，酒罈見底又添新罈。眼看氣氛正酣，呂信索性拍開一罈壓箱底的老酒，非要與你再拚一輪。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(3);",
    "links": [
      44
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 44,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "「[em7]把酒碗往你面前重重一放[/em7]，方才那幾碗都不算數——這罈老酒才是真章！敢不敢陪你信哥，走完這一罈？！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Anger_2);",
    "links": [
      45
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 45,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "BeginDiceRoll(Auto,AlcoholToleranceCheck,8);",
    "links": [
      46
    ],
    "Description": "第二輪自動酒量檢定觸發點 (難度8)"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 46,
    "actorID": "MC0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      47,
      51
    ],
    "Description": "第二輪酒量檢定後緩衝節點"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 47,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（一罈走完，你眼神依舊清亮。反倒是旁邊——郭嘉的舌頭，已經開始打結了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,AlcoholTolerance,10);",
    "links": [
      48
    ],
    "Condition": "IsPassDice() == true",
    "Description": "第二輪酒量檢定成功"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 48,
    "actorID": "MC7",
    "text": "[panel=3]「[em7]臉頰泛紅，手指虛虛點著你[/em7]，你、你這廝……嗝……當真是海量……我郭奉孝今日、算是服了……」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC7,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(3,MC7,Nervous);",
    "links": [
      49
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 49,
    "actorID": "MC3",
    "text": "[panel=2]「[em7]伸手扶住搖搖欲墜的郭嘉，自己也坐得不太穩[/em7]，……奉孝兄，你醉了。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(3);SetPortrait(MC3,pic=3);",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 50,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "「[em7]勾住你的脖子，仰天大笑[/em7]，哈哈哈！好！這天下能陪老子喝到這份上的，你是頭一個！往後你的事，就是我呂信的事！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC2,5);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC3,5);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC7,5);",
    "links": [
      61
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 51,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（這罈老酒後勁極猛，半罈下肚，天旋地轉——你和郭嘉幾乎同時軟倒在桌沿。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      52
    ],
    "Condition": "IsPassDice() == false",
    "Description": "第二輪酒量檢定失敗"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 52,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「[em7]撐著桌角，舌頭發沉[/em7]，信哥……這罈……算你、算你贏……」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Nervous_2);",
    "links": [
      53
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 53,
    "actorID": "MC7",
    "text": "[panel=3]「[em7]已經趴在桌上，含糊不清[/em7]，……不虧……長遠看……不虧……」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC7,pic=3);",
    "links": [
      54
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 54,
    "actorID": "MC3",
    "text": "[panel=2]「[em7]默默把兩人的酒碗挪遠，替你們換上茶水[/em7]，……都少喝些。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC3,pic=3);",
    "links": [
      55
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 55,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "「[em7]獨自舉罈灌了一大口，暢快大笑[/em7]，哈哈哈哈！一群三杯倒！罷了罷了——能捨命陪到這份上，也算給足老子面子！這罈，我自個兒收尾！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC2,5);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC3,5);ModifyData(FavorabilityExp,MC7,5);",
    "links": [
      61
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 56,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（烈酒入喉如刀割，你猛地嗆咳起來，咳得眼淚都快出來了，方才那豪氣干雲的架勢頓時破了功。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      57
    ],
